######################################################################
# WO3 - Rietveld refinement of laboratory Cu K-alpha powder data
# (Co3O4 + WO3 heated to 500 C; two-phase refinement, GSAS-II 5.7.8)
# gamma-WO3 (monoclinic tungsten trioxide), conventional P 21/n setting.
# Starting coordinates: neutron refinement of Loopstra & Boldrini,
# Acta Cryst. 21 (1966) 158 (COD 2311041), transformed from the P 21/c
# (beta = 136.06 deg) description to the standard P 21/n cell.
# Only the lattice parameters were refined against the present data;
# atom coordinates and Uiso were held fixed (see report.md).
# Refined weight fraction in the crystalline mixture: 75.2 +/- 0.2 wt% (estimated-standard-deviation from the refinement only)
# Overall fit: Rwp = 2.78%, Rp = 2.13%, GOF = 1.62
# Phase residuals: RF = 2.9%, RF^2 = 4.62% on 440 reflections
######################################################################
######################################################################
data_WO3

# phase info for WO3 follows
_pd_phase_name  WO3
_cell_length_a  7.30472(15)
_cell_length_b  7.53623(14)
_cell_length_c  7.69332(18)
_cell_angle_alpha  90.0000
_cell_angle_beta  90.6541(28)
_cell_angle_gamma  90.0000
_cell_volume  423.490
_symmetry_cell_setting  monoclinic
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M  "P 21/n"
loop_
    _space_group_symop_id
    _space_group_symop_operation_xyz
     1  x,y,z
     2  1/2-x,1/2+y,1/2-z
     3  -x,-y,-z
     4  1/2+x,1/2-y,1/2+z

